<title>UK: ICI H1 profits slump, sales decline.</title>
<headline>ICI H1 profits slump, sales decline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.0		   vs 19.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 12.5		   vs 12.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     160		    vs 367</p>
<p> Turnover		   4.967 bln	    vs 5.297 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - ICI announced its first-half pre-tax profit figure in a trading statement last week.</p>
<p>Full company name - Imperial Chemical Industries Plc Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
